    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon</em></p><p>This 5-foot-tall stone post is carved with runes. As a Magic action, you can touch the runes to activate the pylon and choose one of the following triggers:</p><ul><li><p>A creature or an item casts a spell of a particular school of magic.</p></li><li><p>A creature takes 5 or more damage.</p></li><li><p>An object takes 10 or more damage.</p></li></ul><p>While the pylon is active, if the chosen trigger happens within 300 feet of it, the pylon rings out an alarm for 10 seconds that can be heard up to 300 feet away.</p><p>You can deactivate the pylon as a Magic action.</p>",
